# === Core Philosophy ===
msgid "Philosophy_1"
msgstr "History is not a backdrop."

msgid "Philosophy_2"
msgstr "History IS the world itself."

msgid "Philosophy_3"
msgstr "The world does not wait for a hero."

msgid "Philosophy_4"
msgstr "The choices of billions of ordinary people shape an era."

msgid "Philosophy_5"
msgstr "The player is not the chosen one."

msgid "Philosophy_6"
msgstr "The player is merely a life born on the land of Huaxia."

