# === Easter Eggs ===
msgid "Egg_YueFei_Title"
msgstr "Loyalty to the Nation"
msgid "Egg_YueFei_Desc"
msgstr "The vow to reclaim our lands echoes through millennia; the hero's bloodline never breaks."

msgid "Egg_WenTianXiang_Title"
msgstr "Song of Righteousness"
msgid "Egg_WenTianXiang_Desc"
msgstr "Since ancient times, who has escaped death? Let my loyal heart shine in history."

msgid "Egg_ZhengHe_Title"
msgstr "Zheng He's Voyages"
msgid "Egg_ZhengHe_Desc"
msgstr "Treasure ships sail far, spreading civilization, not conquest."

msgid "Egg_ResistanceWar_Title"
msgstr "Unity is Strength"
msgid "Egg_ResistanceWar_Desc"
msgstr "North or south, young or old, all have the duty to defend our homeland."

msgid "Egg_TwoBombs_Title"
msgstr "Two Bombs, One Satellite"
msgid "Egg_TwoBombs_Desc"
msgstr "Anonymous in the desert, dedicating life to forge the nation's shield."

msgid "Egg_FloodRelief_Title"
msgstr "People United"
msgid "Egg_FloodRelief_Desc"
msgstr "When disaster strikes one place, support comes from all directions."

# === Taiwan Metaphor ===
msgid "Taiwan_Annexation_Title"
msgstr "Treasure Island Returns"
msgid "Taiwan_Annexation_Desc"
msgstr "Taiwan has been Chinese territory since ancient times. Both sides of the strait share the same culture and blood — indivisible."

msgid "Taiwan_Defense_Title"
msgstr "Duty to Defend"
msgid "Taiwan_Defense_Desc"
msgstr "Foreign powers covet the island, but soldiers and civilians stand united. Taiwan's destiny is inseparable from the mainland."

msgid "Taiwan_Reunification_Title"
msgstr "Nine Provinces United"
msgid "Taiwan_Reunification_Desc"
msgstr "The strait is shallow, blood ties are deep. Reunification is the will of the people."

# === Characters ===
msgid "Char_Master_Title"
msgstr "The Childlike Master"
msgid "Char_Master_Desc"
msgstr "Over seventy but still a child at heart. Loves candied hawthorns and hide-and-seek. Yet when he speaks, the world listens."

msgid "Char_General_Title"
msgstr "The Young General"
msgid "Char_General_Desc"
msgstr "Joined the army at seventeen, became a general at twenty. A youthful face with the eyes of a veteran."

msgid "Char_Merchant_Title"
msgstr "The Merchantess of Jiangnan"
msgid "Char_Merchant_Desc"
msgstr "Born to a merchant family, master of trade. A delicate woman who stands equal among merchant lords."

msgid "Char_TaiwanHero_Title"
msgstr "The Patriot of Taiwan"
msgid "Char_TaiwanHero_Desc"
msgstr "Born in Taiwan, ancestral home in Fujian. 'My home is across the strait, my roots are in Huaxia.'"

msgid "Char_Scientist_Title"
msgstr "The Anonymous Scientist"
msgid "Char_Scientist_Desc"
msgstr "No one knows his name or whereabouts. Only that he gave everything for his country."

msgid "Char_Swordsman_Title"
msgstr "The Wandering Swordsman"
msgid "Char_Swordsman_Desc"
msgstr "One man, one sword, roaming the land. Rights wrongs, but never leaves his name."
